  "sourceTitle": "Peaches And Cream Oatmeal",
  "sourceText": "Peaches And Cream Oatmeal\nBy: Active Foodie\nPublished: Thursday, December 10, 2009 - 10:15pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1/4 cup frozen peaches\n cup quick cooking oats\n1/2 cup non-fat milk\n2 teaspoons low fat cream cheese\n1 teaspoon agave\n1/2 teaspoon cinnamon\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Microwave the peaches for 30 seconds. 2 Add oats, milk, cream cheese, agave and cinnamon.  Microwave for 1 minute, stir, and enjoy!",
